---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Zero Image Retention Guarantee | Font Finder"
  description="Read Font Finder's clear privacy policy. We never store, log, or share your uploaded images. Image processing happens strictly in-memory."
>
  <article class="py-12 sm:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-[1000px] mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#ff4d00]"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#727272]">01 / PRIVACY ARCHITECTURE</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-medium text-[#262626] tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base text-[#727272] leading-relaxed">
        Last revised: March 2026. Zero image retention and in-memory execution guarantee.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#727272]">
      
      <section class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e5e7eb] bg-[#f9f9f9] p-8 shadow-[0_0_0_6px_rgb(249,249,249)]">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#ff4d00] pl-3 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#262626]">
            1. Uploaded Images & Zero Retention
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          When you drag, drop, or paste an image into Font Finder:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 mt-3">
          <li>The image is rendered into an in-memory HTML5 Canvas element inside your browser.</li>
          <li>Pixel values are analyzed strictly in client-side memory.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[#262626]">No image is ever uploaded, stored on a remote server, or retained in any permanent database.</strong></li>
          <li>Refreshing the page or selecting a new image purges the previous memory immediately.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e5e7eb] bg-[#f9f9f9] p-8 shadow-[0_0_0_6px_rgb(249,249,249)]">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[#ff4d00] pl-3 mb-3">
          <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#262626]">
            2. Cookies & Local Storage
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          Font Finder does not track you across sessions. We do not use advertising trackers or third-party profiling cookies. Browser <code class="font-mono text-xs text-[#262626] bg-white px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#e5e7eb]">localStorage</code> is solely used to preserve your theme preference.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
